      "curator_note": "Table 8.2, row 7: OE+. radical-site displacement 'rd' (radical site drives new pi-bond formation with expulsion of D.). Book draws ~3 fishhooks (S-radical odd electron -> forming C=S pi; one C-H electron -> that pi; the other C-H electron -> departing H.), plus a stylistic connecting loop; all 3 electron-flow moves encoded. Printed example methanethiol CH3-S(+.)-H -> H2C=S(+)H (m/z 47, monoisotopic 46.9950) + .H. Mechanistically an alpha-type pi-forming radical cleavage; the book classifies it 'rd', distinct from its alpha row. No m/z / intensity printed."
